  <section id="rooms">
    <h2>Room types, sizes and beds</h2>
    <p>This resort is really two products: village rooms in the Casitas, Ranchos and Cabanas, and rooms in Gran Destino Tower. Official listings describe village views of the courtyard, garden, landscaping, lake, pool or parking. Preferred village rooms are close to El Centro, dining, shopping and transportation. Tower rooms are listed as Resort View or Water View, with a Club Access category that includes lounge access.</p>
