  <section id="dining">
    <h2>Dining</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Toledo – Tapas, Steak &amp; Seafood</strong> is the Signature restaurant in Gran Destino Tower.</li>
      <li><strong>Maya Grill</strong> and <strong>Rix Sports Bar &amp; Grill</strong> are table-service options in the El Centro area, based on a Disney travel-agent overview. Confirm hours and menus before you go <span class="verify">[verify still current]</span>.</li>
      <li><strong>Three Bridges Bar &amp; Grill</strong> sits on the lake, reached by walkways.</li>
      <li><strong>Café Rix</strong> is a quick-service / café option listed in the same overview.</li>
      <li>You can use mobile ordering in the My Disney Experience app at the quick-service spots.</li>
      <li><strong>Park dining reservations:</strong> Disney resort guests can book their whole stay (up to 10 nights) starting 60 days before arrival.</li>
    </ul>
