  <section id="pools">
    <h2>Pools and things to do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>The Lost City of Cibola Pool</strong> is the main pool at the Dig Site. Official pages describe a Mayan-ruins theme, a 123-foot waterslide, the largest hot tub on Walt Disney World property (room for 22), a kiddie pool, a white-sand volleyball court, the Iguana Arcade and Siesta's pool bar.</li>
      <li><strong>Three leisure pools</strong> sit in the Casitas, Ranchos and Cabanas villages.</li>
      <li>Towels are free at the pools. Hours and lifeguard coverage vary and can change.</li>
    </ul>
